    "description": "<p>Spend 3 Hope and choose an ally<br>within Close range.<br>They are placed under a death-lock<br>protocol, such as a cardiac override,<br>neural backup, emergency blood pump,<br>trauma stasis patch, or Last-chance<br>Auto-injector.<br>When this ally would make a death<br>move, they clear a Hit Point instead.<br>This effect ends when it saves the<br>target from a death move, you use<br>Death Lock on another target, or you<br>take a long rest.</p>",
